license: MIT
abstract: "A local-first desktop chat interface for locally managed language models through an Ollama-compatible provider, with automatic compatible-model discovery, streamed responses and in-session conversation context. Ask the Model is being developed toward natural-language exploration of scientific dynamical-model repositories; repository-aware retrieval and scientific provenance are not yet implemented in v0.2.1."
keywords:
  - local AI
  - local-first
  - large language models
  - Ollama
  - scientific models
  - dynamical models
  - natural-language interface
  - research software
